  "description": "On-Ha, who has never left the palace. She has always been interested in sex, but is dumbfounded when she is told that she must marry a child who will soon be seven years old, unlike herself who is already an adult. On-Ha wants to experience various things before marriage, and a book falls in front of her, and from it jumps the nine-tailed fox Ain and the yellow-haired goblin Cheongrin.\n\n *\"Release our seal, and I will grant you what you wish.\"*\n\nAs she dates the monsters under the pretext of seeing the world, On-Ha begins to feel a strange thrill towards Ain and Cheongrin...\n\n(Source: Ridibooks, translated)",
